Horticultural Reviews</source><year>1993</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>145</fpage><lpage>182</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hong</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Pan</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Welti</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Phospholipase D&#x003b1;3 is involved in the hyperosmotic response in <italic>Arabidopsis</italic></article-title><source>The Plant Cell</source><year>2008</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>803</fpage><lpage>816</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18364466</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name><name><surname>Osborne</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ethylene, natural regulator of leaf abscission</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1970</year><volume>225</volume><fpage>1019</fpage><lpage>1022</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16056901</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kabachevskaya</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Liakhnovich</surname><given-names>GV</given-names></name><name><surname>Kisel</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Volotovski</surname><given-names>ID</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Red/far-red light modulates phospholipase D activity in oat seedlings. Relation of enzyme photosensitivity to photosynthesis</article-title><source>Journal of Plant Physiology</source><year>2007</year><volume>164</volume><fpage>108</fpage><lpage>110</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16621133</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation c